#: ../../installation.md:1
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalación"

#: ../../installation.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide covers the full setup process for running OSTRAM LAC on a "
"Windows machine."
msgstr ""
"Esta guía cubre el proceso completo de configuración para ejecutar OSTRAM"
" LAC en una máquina Windows."

#: ../../installation.md:9
msgid ""
"Installation steps: clone the repository, create the Conda environment, "
"set up a solver and verify the installation."
msgstr ""
"Pasos de instalación: clonar el repositorio, crear el entorno Conda, "
"configurar el solver y verificar la instalación."

#: ../../installation.md:12
msgid "System requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos del sistema"

#: ../../installation.md:14
msgid "**Operating System:** Windows 10 or higher"
msgstr "**Sistema operativo:** Windows 10 o superior"

#: ../../installation.md:15
msgid "**Git:** [Git for Windows](https://gitforwindows.org/) (version 2.40+)"
msgstr "**Git:** [Git for Windows](https://gitforwindows.org/) (versión 2.40+)"

#: ../../installation.md:16
msgid ""
"**Python distribution:** "
"[Miniconda](https://docs.conda.io/en/latest/miniconda.html) or "
"[Anaconda](https://www.anaconda.com/download)"
msgstr ""
"**Distribución de Python:** "
"[Miniconda](https://docs.conda.io/en/latest/miniconda.html) o "
"[Anaconda](https://www.anaconda.com/download)"

#: ../../installation.md:17
msgid ""
"**Solver:** At least one of the following linear / mixed-integer "
"programming solvers:"
msgstr ""
"**Solver:** Al menos uno de los siguientes solvers de programación lineal"
" / entera mixta:"

#: ../../installation.md:18
msgid ""
"[GLPK](https://www.gnu.org/software/glpk/) (open source, installed "
"automatically with the Conda environment)"
msgstr ""
"[GLPK](https://www.gnu.org/software/glpk/) (código abierto, se instala "
"automáticamente con el entorno Conda)"

#: ../../installation.md:19
msgid ""
"[CBC](https://github.com/coin-or/Cbc) (open source, installed "
"automatically with the Conda environment)"
msgstr ""
"[CBC](https://github.com/coin-or/Cbc) (código abierto, se instala "
"automáticamente con el entorno Conda)"

#: ../../installation.md:20
msgid ""
"[CPLEX](https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio) "
"(commercial, IBM)"
msgstr ""
"[CPLEX](https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio) "
"(comercial, IBM)"

#: ../../installation.md:21
msgid "[Gurobi](https://www.gurobi.com/) (commercial, free academic licence)"
msgstr "[Gurobi](https://www.gurobi.com/) (comercial, licencia académica gratuita)"

#: ../../installation.md:23
msgid "Clone the repository"
msgstr "Clonar el repositorio"

#: ../../installation.md:30
msgid "Conda environment"
msgstr "Entorno Conda"

